.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ヒロイン」back numberさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はやっぱりこの曲かな◎\n京都で雪を見たときに\n真っ先に聴きたくなった。\n等身大な歌詞だからこそ\n心に残るし歌いたくなる。\n\"雪が綺麗と笑うのは君がいい\nでも寒いねって嬉しそうなのも\"\n名曲だな〜！\n切ない雰囲気も大好き。\n日常的を切り取った歌詞も\nより切なくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈の唇もすき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんぜひ\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21918":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/12/08/5079932/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム現役！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの中では\n一番おねーさんなんだ( ^o^ )♡\nお誕生日が早いからね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち高校生はtype-C。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/12/08/5079932/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご無沙汰してますひめたんです～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに更新空いたこと\n過去ないよ～わかんないけど( ºωº )\nみなさん元気にしてますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブまであと少し......なんだけど\n毎日覚えることが多くて\n頑張ってるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea